### ---------------- Todo Application APIs ----------------

### Add a new todo
POST http://localhost:8080/api/todos
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Todo 3",
    "description": "Description 3",
    "completed": false
}
### Get all todos
GET http://localhost:8080/api/todos

### Update todo
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/todos/86d82630-c1ee-4872-bc3c-a4db908c1946
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Todo 1a",
  "description": "New description of the todo 1",
  "completed": false
}

### Get all todos
//TODO Missing test to fail on status not being updated
GET http://localhost:8080/api/todos/1

### Text search
POST http://localhost:8080/api/todos/search
Content-Type: application/json

"CREATED"



### ---------------- Elasticsearch APIs ----------------

### Elasticsearch list of indexes
GET http://localhost:9200/_cat/indices?v

### Elasticsearch todo schema
GET http://localhost:9200/todo/_mapping

### Elasticsearch delete todo index
DELETE http://localhost:9200/todo

### Elasticsearch direct query
GET http://localhost:9200/todo/_search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": {
    "match_all": {}
  }
}

### Elasticsearch same query
GET http://localhost:9200/todo/_search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": {
    "multi_match": {
      "query": "1",
      "fields": ["*"]
    }
  }
}
